#, no-c-format
msgid "Hit Points"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These two sliders allow you to define the hitpoints for each of the two "
"players; you might want to decrease the hitpoints for a player to give that "
"player a handycap."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "Refresh time"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Time between two screen refreshes in milliseconds. All other settings are "
"independent of the refresh time."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Red Player</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can define whether the red player gets controlled by the AI, and "
"also choose the skill level of the AI for this player. Just experiment with "
"the different skill level to find one which fits you."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
